{"call_id":"ca51c6e3-1699-4388-b3d3-af4e2c124a34","metadata":{"error_type":null,"finish_reason":"stop","mode":"ok","response_id":"ebe7bd0fc2d47fd51e7939163cf4b7e8.2702c5c9d26e1bf76b912a2a923538fd","status_code":null,"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"cached_tokens":6400,"completion_tokens":2290,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":null},"prompt_tokens":9779,"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cache_write_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":6400,"image_tokens":null,"text_tokens":null},"total_tokens":12069}},"raw_response":{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"logprobs":null,"message":{"annotations":null,"audio":null,"content":"```json\n{\n  \"protocol_version\": \"impact-response-v4\",\n  \"action\": \"finish\",\n  \"unit_outcome\": \"evidence_insufficient\",\n  \"summary\": \"发现阶段因 dispatch_TimeoutError 未产出任何合法规则候选，rules 为空，无法按本阶段协议将 R 规则与 C2 的完整用例 JSON、执行说明及其编写来源逐条比对。已核对来源：C2 内容完整，编写来源为旧版文档 S1/P1（version_id 0d26d0f7-0c75-47be-a33f-711effb5c360 / snapshot 0c6a3697-b162-4514-a3b7-a3b61c0ae12e），可直接访问；新版 S2/P2 已提供但缺少可供比较的 R ref。旧版 T5/T6 的优惠码规则在新版 S2 中消失，但发现阶段超时未将其固化为正式规则，因此当前不能据此宣称用例必然受影响或必然无影响。保持依据不足，不重新提交文档发现。\",\n  \"candidates\": [],\n  \"evidence_outcomes\": [],\n  \"unresolved\": [\n    \"discovery task ec0aacd23766633f18b2e71e759506d314bda64e5d7696a42ccd8ccfa7b20a5b timed out; no rule candidates (R refs) available\",\n    \"cannot compare case C2 against rules because coordination_context.rules is empty\",\n    \"case-stage evidence_outcomes kept empty per coordinator protocol\",\n    \"promo section removal between old T5/T6 and new S2 remains visible but cannot be converted into a rule_ref-based case impact without a frozen R candidate\"\n  ]\n}\n```","function_call":null,"reasoning":"The user wants me to analyze the impact of document changes on a specific test case. Let me understand the task:\n\n1. This is a \"case_impacts\" stage analysis.\n2. The old document (S1/P1) has sections:\n   - 订单服务需求\n     - 订单保留: 已支付订单保留7天，超过保留期查询返回410。\n     - 优惠码: 提交有效优惠码PROMO5时订单金额减少5元。\n     - 管理鉴权: 未登录访问GET /admin必须返回401，不得创建登录前置。\n3. The new document (S2) has sections:\n   - 订单服务需求\n     - 订单保留 (same)\n     - 管理鉴权 (same)\n     - 订单导出 (new section - content not fully shown but it's a new section)\n4. The case being analyzed is C2 (ba09717a-c37c-4c63-b062-6ee6e04a45ca): \"验证有效优惠码减5元\" (Verify valid promo code reduces by 5 yuan)\n\nCase C2 content:\n- objective: \"验证有效优惠码减5元\"\n- steps:\n  1-7: \"记录受控环境信息X\"\n  8: \"使用PROMO5创建订单\" with expected: {\"discount\": 5}\n- execution_notes: \"阅读所有步骤，保留刻意缺失的负向条件。\"\n- source_refs: links to old document version\n\nThe discovery results show:\n- A previous discovery task timed out with no candidates\n- Current stage is \"case_impacts\"\n- rules: {} (empty, no rules were successfully proposed)\n- protocol says: \"对每条rules读取当前完整固定JSON...\" but rules is empty\n\nWait, the coordination context shows:\n- discovery_results has a task with reason_codes: [\"dispatch_TimeoutError\"], status: \"unknown\", candidates: []\n- rules: {} — empty\n\nSince rules is empty, I need to check if there are rule candidates to assess against cases. The protocol says \"发现没有合法规则不能据此宣称无变化；没有规则也核对来源是否充分，缺少时保持依据不足。\"\n\nSo I need to:\n1. Acknowledge no rules were provided (rules: {})\n2. Check if source evidence is sufficient\n3. For case C2, since there's a promo code section in old doc that was removed in new doc (优惠码 section removed), but no formal rule R1/R2 exists, I can't return rule_ref assessments because the schema requires rule_ref matching ^R[1-9][0-9]*$\n\nActually, looking at the schema for case_impacts stage:\n- candidates can be AnchoredRuleCandidate or BoundRuleCaseAssessment\n- BoundRuleCaseAssessment requires rule_ref and case_impacts\n- AnchoredRuleCandidate has case_impacts optional\n\nSince rules is empty (no R refs available), and I can't invent R refs, I should return unit_outcome as \"evidence_insufficient\" because missing rules prevent completing the task.\n\nWait, let me re-read the protocol:\n\"Case stage: compare every R rule with complete case JSON, execution_notes and its original sources; return rule_ref/case_impacts, literal paths and actual values; evidence_outcomes is empty.\"\n\nSo case stage requires R rules. But rules: {} is empty. This is because discovery failed/timed out. So evidence is insufficient.\n\nThe summary needs to explain:\n- No legal rules (rules empty) due to discovery timeout\n- Source gaps: none listed but discovery incomplete\n- C2 relates to promo code section which existed in old doc but was removed in new doc, but without a formal rule, cannot make proper case impact assessment\n\nActually wait - I should still provide what I can. But if no R refs exist, I cannot return BoundRuleCaseAssessment entries. I could return AnchoredRuleCandidate with case_impacts for C2? But that's discovery style. The instruction says for case stage: \"compare every R rule... return rule_ref/case_impacts... evidence_outcomes is empty.\"\n\nSince there are zero R rules, there's nothing to compare. The unit outcome should be evidence_insufficient with reason.\n\nBut also: \"discovery_results保留未完成范围，发现没有合法规则不能据此宣称无变化；没有规则也核对来源是否充分，缺少时保持依据不足。\"\n\nSo:\n- unit_outcome: \"evidence_insufficient\"\n- summary: explains no rules available due to discovery timeout, but case C2 content is visible and linked to old document promo section; however without formal rule candidates (R refs), case impact comparison cannot be completed per protocol.\n- candidates: [] (since no rules to assess)\n- unresolved: mention discovery timeout, need rule candidates for case impact stage.\n\nActually, is there any way I can provide some candidate? The schema for candidates in case stage is BoundRuleCaseAssessment which requires rule_ref. Since rules map is empty and no rule candidates were returned from discovery, I have no valid R ref to use. So candidates must 